                <head>324. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On November 6, 1963, Secretary-General U
                        Thant proposed that Felix
                        Schnyder’s term of office as High Commissioner for Refugees be
                    extended for 2 years, from January 1, 1964, to December 31, 1965. On November 27
                    the General Assembly decided, by acclamation, to extend Schnyder’s term. (National Archives and Records
                    Administration, RG 59, Central Files 1960–63, REF
                    3 UN, and Yearbook of the United Nations, 1963,
                    page 367)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
